 {:legal/rule-id "gbr.laspo-2012-s56",
  :legal/fact-kind "rule",
  :legal/summary
  "2013年4月1日以降、人身傷害・死亡に係る損害賠償請求について、regulated person による紹介料の支払い・受領が禁止される。solicitor・claims management company・保険会社・保険仲介者を捕捉し、「payment」にはあらゆる形態の対価を含む。",
  :legal/retrieved-at "2026-07-26",
  :legal/verification "primary-source-read",
  :legal/instrument
  "Legal Aid, Sentencing and Punishment of Offenders Act 2012 (c.10)",
  :legal/quote
  "(1) A regulated person is in breach of this section if— (a) the regulated person refers prescribed legal business to another person and is paid or has been paid for the referral, or (b) prescribed legal business is referred to the regulated person, and the regulated person pays or has paid for the referral. (2) A regulated person is also in breach of this section if in providing legal services in the course of prescribed legal business the regulated person— (a) arranges for another person to provide services to the client, and (b) is paid or has been paid for making the arrangement.",
  :legal/verification-note
  "legislation.gov.uk の XML から s.56 本文を取得して読了。",
  :legal/jurisdiction "GBR",
  :legal/url "https://www.legislation.gov.uk/ukpga/2012/10/section/56",
  :legal/rule-title "LASPO 2012 s.56 — rules against referral fees",
  :source/dataset "legal-jurisdiction-rules",
  :legal/verified true,
  :db/id -95,
  :legal/topic "fee-sharing referral",
  :legal/established-date "2013-04-01",
  :legal/url-provenance "official-legislation-site"}
